[(The [delread~] and [delread4~] objects read from a delay line allocated in a)]
[([delwrite~] object with the same name. You can use more than one [delread~])]
[(and/or [delread4~] objects for the same [delwrite~] object. If the specified)]
[(delay time in [delread~]/[delread4~] is longer than the size of the delay)]
